   "t": "the mountains, forms the crater's edge."
  },
  {
   "i": 1089,
   "src": "e47dce791b8f",
   "t": "This signal comes from inside that."
  },
  {
   "i": 1104,
   "src": "993c2264a1a0",
   "t": "S-so... We're finally entering the crater's"
  },
  {
   "i": 1107,
   "src": "3887461dc74b",
   "t": "center!"
  },
  {
   "i": 1112,
   "src": "c12c268fadf2",
